<title>HONG KONG: Berjaya unit launches US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Berjaya unit launches US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Berjaya Group Capital (Cayman) has launched a US$100 million secured guaranteed floating rate note issue to be guaranteed by the Berjaya Group, arranger Chase Manhattan Asia said.</p>
<p>The five-year notes have a issue price of 99.80 and a re-offer price of par. They will pay a margin of 140 basis points over the three-month London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
